Mango Studios' own files in this repository (the skill workflows, rubric, judge
protocol, scripts and installer) are proprietary to Mango Studios and are not
licensed for redistribution.

Each skill's modules/ folder contains third-party skills that keep their
original licenses (MIT, Apache 2.0, CC BY 4.0 and others). Each skill's
SOURCES.md lists where every module came from; license files and credit lines
inside a module apply to that module.
